        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Hundred Days' Reform</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Where</span><span class="info-stat-val">the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/qing-empire">Qing Empire</a>, with the court at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/beijing">Beijing</a>; <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kang-youwei">Kang Youwei</a> and Liang Qichao fled afterwards to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/japan">Japan</a></span></div>
